[31m-not cover: **geography, spatial accessibility and equity**.[m
[32m+[m[32mThat dashboard showed clinics, not people. I wanted to see the same indicators by where patients live, and whether the more deprived areas were worse off. The indicators are computed by my C++ engine [emr-access-indicators](https://github.com/jbenoitds/emr-access-indicators); this project adds the geography, spatial accessibility and equity views.[m
